\t\n\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t</figure>\n\t\t</div>\n</div><div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"va\">\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Voice / Actor</h3>\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><ul style=\"list-style: none; margin: 0\"><li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.imdb.com/name/nm8703995\">Ellie Heydon</a></li></ul></div>\n</div><div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"role\">\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Role</h3>\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Brain reader</div>\n</div><section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\"><h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Stats</h2><div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"race\">\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Race</h3>\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Elf</div>\n</div></section><section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color pi-collapse pi-collapse-closed\"><h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Technical</h2><div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"uid\">\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\"><div class=\"bg3wiki-tech-label\">UID</div></h3>\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><div class=\"bg3wiki-tech-data\"><code>S_COL_BrainReader_Head_Character</code> <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:S_COL_BrainReader_Head_Character+type:localcharacter%2Cglobalcharacter%2Ccharactertemplate\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:S_COL_BrainReader_Head_Character+type:localcharacter%2Cglobalcharacter%2Ccharactertemplate\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></div></div>\n</div><div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"uuid\">\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\"><div class=\"bg3wiki-tech-label\">UUID</div></h3>\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><div class=\"bg3wiki-tech-data\"><code>034ec7e7-948b-4c1e-9a38-82efbe459ee4</code> <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:034ec7e7-948b-4c1e-9a38-82efbe459ee4\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:034ec7e7-948b-4c1e-9a38-82efbe459ee4\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></div></div>\n</div><div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"stats\">\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\"><div class=\"bg3wiki-tech-label\">Stats</div></h3>\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><div class=\"bg3wiki-tech-data\"><code>Elf_Commoner</code> <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Elf_Commoner+type:statscharacter\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Elf_Commoner+type:statscharacter\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></div></div>\n</div></section></aside>\nThe <b>Slack-Skinned Head</b> and Mind-Archive Interface are side-by-side in the <a href=\"/wiki/Mind_Flayer_Colony\" title=\"Mind Flayer Colony\">Mind Flayer Colony</a>. They are accessible after defeating a <a href=\"/wiki/Death_Shepherd\" title=\"Death Shepherd\">Death Shepherd</a>, some winged horrors and various Zombies. \n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Involvement\">Involvement</span></h2>\n<p>Various 'minds' in green jars can be found and inserted into the Mind-Archive Interface, which lets the player character have a conversation with the unfortunate creature via the Slack-Skinned Head. \n</p><p><b>There are 2 minds to be found on the <a href=\"/wiki/Nautiloid\" title=\"Nautiloid\">Nautiloid</a> in the <a href=\"/wiki/Prologue\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Prologue\">Prologue</a>:</b>\n</p>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Dark_Mind\" title=\"Dark Mind\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/bf/Brain_Jar_Memory_A_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Brain_Jar_Memory_A_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/bf/Brain_Jar_Memory_A_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Brain_Jar_Memory_A_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/bf/Brain_Jar_Memory_A_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Brain_Jar_Memory_A_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/bf/Brain_Jar_Memory_A_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Brain_Jar_Memory_A_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/bf/Brain_Jar_Memory_A_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Dark_Mind\" title=\"Dark Mind\">Dark Mind</a></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Slave_Mind\" title=\"Slave Mind\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/bf/Brain_Jar_Memory_A_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Brain_Jar_Memory_A_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/bf/Brain_Jar_Memory_A_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Brain_Jar_Memory_A_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/bf/Brain_Jar_Memory_A_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Brain_Jar_Memory_A_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/bf/Brain_Jar_Memory_A_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Brain_Jar_Memory_A_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/bf/Brain_Jar_Memory_A_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Slave_Mind\" title=\"Slave Mind\">Slave Mind</a></span></li></ul>\n<p><b>There are 6 minds to be found within the <a href=\"/wiki/Mind_Flayer_Colony\" title=\"Mind Flayer Colony\">Mind Flayer Colony</a> in <a href=\"/wiki/Act_Two\" title=\"Act Two\">Act Two</a>:</b>\n</p>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Butchered_Mind\" title=\"Butchered Mind\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/bf/Brain_Jar_Memory_A_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Brain_Jar_Memory_A_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/bf/Brain_Jar_Memory_A_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Brain_Jar_Memory_A_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/bf/Brain_Jar_Memory_A_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Brain_Jar_Memory_A_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/bf/Brain_Jar_Memory_A_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Brain_Jar_Memory_A_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/bf/Brain_Jar_Memory_A_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Butchered_Mind\" title=\"Butchered Mind\">Butchered Mind</a></span> - on top of a set of shelves with discarded armour, in the <a href=\"/wiki/Mind_Flayer_Colony#Morgue\" title=\"Mind Flayer Colony\">Morgue</a> where <a href=\"/wiki/Chop\" title=\"Chop\">Chop</a> works</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Closed_Mind\" title=\"Closed Mind\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/bf/Brain_Jar_Memory_A_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Brain_Jar_Memory_A_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/bf/Brain_Jar_Memory_A_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Brain_Jar_Memory_A_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/bf/Brain_Jar_Memory_A_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Brain_Jar_Memory_A_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/bf/Brain_Jar_Memory_A_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Brain_Jar_Memory_A_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/bf/Brain_Jar_Memory_A_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Closed_Mind\" title=\"Closed Mind\">Closed Mind</a></span> - on a shelf in <a href=\"/wiki/Ironfinger\" title=\"Ironfinger\">Ironfinger</a>'s room, in the north-western part of the <a href=\"/wiki/Mind_Flayer_Colony\" title=\"Mind Flayer Colony\">Barracks</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fresh_Mind\" title=\"Fresh Mind\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/bf/Brain_Jar_Memory_A_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Brain_Jar_Memory_A_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/bf/Brain_Jar_Memory_A_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Brain_Jar_Memory_A_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/bf/Brain_Jar_Memory_A_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Brain_Jar_Memory_A_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/bf/Brain_Jar_Memory_A_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Brain_Jar_Memory_A_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/bf/Brain_Jar_Memory_A_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Fresh_Mind\" title=\"Fresh Mind\">Fresh Mind</a></span> - on-top of a stack of mucilaginous boxes beside the elevator leading to the final area</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/True_Mind\" title=\"True Mind\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/bf/Brain_Jar_Memory_A_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Brain_Jar_Memory_A_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/bf/Brain_Jar_Memory_A_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Brain_Jar_Memory_A_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/bf/Brain_Jar_Memory_A_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Brain_Jar_Memory_A_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/bf/Brain_Jar_Memory_A_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Brain_Jar_Memory_A_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/bf/Brain_Jar_Memory_A_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/True_Mind\" title=\"True Mind\">True Mind</a></span> - in front of the head in the <a href=\"/wiki/Mind_Flayer_Colony#Necrotic_Laboratory\" title=\"Mind Flayer Colony\">Necrotic Laboratory</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Waking_Mind\" title=\"Waking Mind\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/bf/Brain_Jar_Memory_A_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Brain_Jar_Memory_A_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/bf/Brain_Jar_Memory_A_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Brain_Jar_Memory_A_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/bf/Brain_Jar_Memory_A_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Brain_Jar_Memory_A_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/bf/Brain_Jar_Memory_A_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Brain_Jar_Memory_A_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/bf/Brain_Jar_Memory_A_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Waking_Mind\" title=\"Waking Mind\">Waking Mind</a></span> - is behind a door in the <a href=\"/wiki/Mind_Flayer_Colony#Necrotic_Laboratory\" title=\"Mind Flayer Colony\">Necrotic Laboratory</a>, <b>only</b> accessible after solving the <a href=\"/wiki/Brain_Mapping_Puzzle\" title=\"Brain Mapping Puzzle\">brain mapping puzzle</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Willing_Mind\" title=\"Willing Mind\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/bf/Brain_Jar_Memory_A_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Brain_Jar_Memory_A_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/bf/Brain_Jar_Memory_A_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Brain_Jar_Memory_A_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/bf/Brain_Jar_Memory_A_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Brain_Jar_Memory_A_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/bf/Brain_Jar_Memory_A_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Brain_Jar_Memory_A_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/bf/Brain_Jar_Memory_A_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Willing_Min